==Latvian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|lv|bat-pro|*kelti}}, from {{inh|lv|ine-pro|*kel-||to raise}}. Cognates include {{cog|lt|kélti}}, {{cog|sla-pro|*čelo}} ({{cog|ru|чело||forehead}}), {{cog|la|excellō||to elevate, to raise}} (< {{m|ine-pro|*keld-}}), {{m|la|celsus||high, outstanding}} (< {{m|ine-pro|*keld-tos}}).<ref>{{R:lv:LEV}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{lv-IPA|tsɛ̂lt|broken}}
{{audio|lv-riga-celt.ogg|lang=lv}}

===Verb===
{{lv-verb|tr|1st|ceļ|cel||cēl}}

