#: {{ux|lv|'''celt''' maisus ārā no ratiem|to '''lift''' ({{=}} take) bags out of the cart|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|ko nevar '''celt''', to nevar nest|what you can't '''lift''', you can't carry|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|'''celt''' roku|to '''raise''' (one's) hand|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|'''celt''' kāju pāri slieksnim|to '''raise''' (one's) foot above the threshold|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|'''celt''' galvu (augstāk)|to '''raise''' (one's) head (higher) ({{=}} be confident)|inline=1}}
