#: {{ux|lv|'''necelt''' (ne savu) kāju|to '''not lift''' one foot ({{=}} to not go)|inline=1}}
# {{lb|lv|with {{m|lv|galdā}} “at the table” or {{m|lv|priekšā}} “ahead, at the front”}} to [[offer]], to [[serve]] ([[food]], [[drink]]s) {{gloss|lit. to lift to the table, to lift forward}}
