# {{lb|lv|of [[skill]]s, [[knowledge]]}} to [[build up]], to [[raise]], to [[improve]], to [[develop]]
#: {{ux|lv|'''celt''' savu kvalifikāciju|to '''raise''', '''improve''' one's skills|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lv|'''celt''' darba ražīgumu|to '''raise''', '''improve''' (work) productivity|inline=1}}
